      "body": "## Motivation\n\nMuse can emit unframed prose followed by a framed tool header without an intervening `<|eom|>`. Both detectors remain inside the unframed body. The client receives raw protocol text instead of a structured tool call.\n\n```text\nLet me check.<|start|>assistant to=get_weather<|message|><atem:function_calls><atem:invoke name=\"get_weather\"><atem:parameter name=\"city\">Paris</atem:parameter></atem:invoke></atem:function_calls>\n```\n\n## Modifications\n\nLet a reserved `<|start|>` marker end unframed prose in both the Muse reasoning detector and tool detector. Limit recovery to an unset recipient. Explicit answer channels retain quoted tool headers, and tool arguments retain marker-like text.\n\nThe reasoning detector also recovers subsequent reasoning and answer channels. This complements the parser-handoff flag fix in https://github.com/ai-dynamo/dynamo/pull/16717.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nThe unchanged runtime reproduces the missing call. All 25 tests in the Muse detector suite pass with the patch. The new coverage checks every two-part split, character chunks, buffered input, marker-like arguments, and the reasoning-to-tool chain after an unframed preamble.\n\n```bash\npython3 test/registered/unit/function_call/test_muse_glimmer_detector.py -v\n```\n\nThese CPU checks use the runtime image with the upstream patch and test file. No model weights or GPU are required.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot run. This change affects response parsing only.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Pre-commit passes for all three changed files.\n- [x] Add coverage to the existing registered CPU suite.\n- [x] Preserve existing quoted-header and channel-scoping tests.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Codex](https://openai.com/codex/) (model: gpt-6.1-sol)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38992168342](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38992168342)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38992168316](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38992168316)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38992168318](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38992168318)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
